From: qualcomm-toolbox <169756160+qcom-toolbox@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:30:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] umi: QCA6390 Bluetooth over SE6's UART (sweetbt=N), firmware
 from the bluetooth partition

sweet_bt.c / sweet_bt.h / SweetBluetooth.cpp from project-BadApple (ios-apollo, MIT; there
ported from the Mi 10 port hackios-xnu-kernel-umi, MIT), adapted for umi: firmware read
read-only from the bluetooth partition's FAT (image/htbtfw20.tlv, image/htnv20.bin), rails voted
with umi's RPMh calls and only logged on failure, umi-only, 30 s after UFS. sweet_wlan.c's FAT
reader works on any partition (sweet_fat_read_file), matches 8.3 names, "*" lists a directory.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
